{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19585","headline":"和李德裕游汉州房公湖二首 一 · 郑澣","name":"和李德裕游汉州房公湖二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太尉留琴地，时移重可寻。\n徽弦一掩抑，风月助登临。\n荣驻青油骑，高张白雪音。\n秖言酬唱美，良史记王箴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑澣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}